<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\crows.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署外観夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The police station looked very different today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Crows. Dozens of crows had the police station surrounded.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could the smell of death be reaching all the way out here?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署受付.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
At the police station, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> was waiting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しか">scolded</STYLE> for not answering my phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しか">scolded</STYLE> while she held me. It was a crying <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> who <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="しか">scolded</STYLE> me.<PG>
But why was that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The sense of actually being scolded would not come.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though I understood the reason I was being scolded, and the reason <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> was crying, and the reason I was being held.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My own heart seemed to be floating somewhere in the air.<PG>
Had <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE> really died?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yesterday morning, we exchanged our usual greetings and headed off, to school and to work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And now the next time we meet I am told it is a flayed body―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> was <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE> and trembling, and she kept apologizing to me and <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE> said nothing. She neither blamed her nor comforted her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow, <STYLE ID="1">Mom</STYLE>'s eyes on <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> even looked like <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="あわ">pity</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka Niimura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">-san, is that right? Would you go up to the second floor?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And then <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>, with another officer at her side, headed for the stairs without a word.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was this "a formal statement on suspicion of murder"?<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I called her name, <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> stopped for a moment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, she did not turn toward me, and at once began to climb the stairs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE> did not kill <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It has to be some mistake...<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"And, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Natsumi Kogori-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, I would like </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> to come down to the basement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"I understand."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a dry, calm answer, enough to surprise even me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hospital or police station, a basement does not leave a good impression.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島怒りバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">Goto</STYLE> seemed to have arrived just then as well.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"They say to come down to the basement for a bit. I'll be back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"The basement...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\霊安室表札.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
The detective called <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> stopped in front of the room with this nameplate on it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Um... well... For the identification... the body, you see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps because it was hard to say, <STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> explained in a mumbling voice that was hard to make out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, he is telling me to identify <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>'s body.<PG>
A flayed body is not something I want to see, even if it is <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, it is because it is <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE> that I do not want to see it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the reason I came here is to make <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>'s innocence clear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If identifying the body gives me any clue that can prove it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had steeled myself for this from the moment I decided to come here with <STYLE ID="4">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"That means you're letting me see </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, doesn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Well, that is so, but... um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">do you know what state the body is in...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"I have heard it is a body flayed of all its skin, too wretched to look at."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Well... that's right... But it is strange for me to say it, and I would rather not recommend it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Your mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> has already had a look, after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"I am allowed to see him, aren't I?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"All right, this way..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\献花台.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A small, dim room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Memorial flowers and an unmarked <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="いはい">memorial tablet</STYLE> had been set out, and the smell of incense hung in the air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Were the crows out front catching the smell of death that this incense was supposed to have covered?<PG>
I could not smell any such smell of death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I could smell was the incense, and the concrete with its somehow inorganic smell ― in fact it is organic matter ― and nothing else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体布.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
In the middle of the room, a stand like a bed with no mattress.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On top of it, 'something' with a white cloth laid over it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that something ― something dark red was sticking slightly out from under it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Under this was <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\献花台.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"A quick look is all I need from you. If you can tell whether it is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">your dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, then say so. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">If you cannot tell... then it can't be helped..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"All right... I'm taking the cloth off."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体布.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> put his hand to the edge of the cloth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Please wait..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Hm? Do you want to stop after all? I don't mind that either..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"No... please let me take the cloth off myself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I brought my halted feet closer to the stand.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"All right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Ise-san</STYLE> stepped one pace back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took hold of the cloth, and slowly turned it back.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\黒塗り.gal" "WAIT" "20" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "堕ちる.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体1.gal" "NORMAL" "4" "300" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
What lay sleeping there was, unmistakably, <STYLE ID="3">my dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Other people might not be able to tell, but there is no mistake: it is <STYLE ID="3">my dad</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However utterly changed the shape, I would not mistake him.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "5!" "200" "540" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"I thought it would be worse than this... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">I can tell perfectly well that it is </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I-I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To an ordinary person it must be an appallingly gruesome body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But no feeling of fear or disgust rose in me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Why... he was flayed, and yet... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">why are the eyes gone too?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "4" "300" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"About that... the direct cause of death was loss of blood from being pecked at by crows... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">the crows..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If this were a stranger, the feeling I would have is this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'What a horrible lump of meat.
{PAUSE ""}
So a human being, skinned and pecked at a little by crows, can turn into something this grotesque, this ugly, this hideous.
{PAUSE ""}
Truly disgusting, offensive, I do not even want to look at it.'<PG>
But if it is someone close to me, someone I love.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I looked at <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>'s face again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\怖い効果音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体全体.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "12" "7000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n500\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\皮剥ぎ死体ノーマル.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Once I looked at the face knowing it was <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, not a <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="みじん">speck</STYLE> of that revulsion rose in me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only...
{PAUSE ""}
only, only,
{PAUSE ""}
only, only, it was hollow.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a feeling of <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="くう">emptiness</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no feeling of fear or revulsion ― not even that; there was nothing but a vacant, hollow feeling.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
